WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.360
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.390
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.110
We're here!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.300
Not quite yet.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.790
Isn't that the bus stop?

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.080
Yeah, that must be it!

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.180
Summer Pool Land!

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.080
STAR☆ANIS, you've worked hard this summer.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.880
You all deserve a proper day off.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.880
A day off?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.880
Yes, and that includes you, Mizuki.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.880
Is this our summer vacation?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.380
Not vacation, off time.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.940
You're a real stickler for details.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.390
Such a stickler.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.960
This much is normal.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.890
Over here! I wanna go to the beach!

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.400
I like that, let's go scuba diving.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.130
What about the jellyfish?

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.400
Could I really see jellyfish?

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.800
We'll need to be careful not to get sunburned.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.830
I'll pack up tons of sunscreen.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.070
I'd prefer a hot spring...

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.410
The beach isn't bad,

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.570
but we're too famous to just show up in public like that.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:03.250
I'm worried something might happen.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:09.100
We've gotten a lot more famous now, so things could get troublesome.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.560
Can't we go in disguise?

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.420
Ichigo is too terrible at it.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.230
No need to fret.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.510
I've already rented out a water park just about two hours from here. {I don't think "pool" quite fits...}

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:19.930
You rented it out?!

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:25.030
Only part of it, but I think it should be enough to avoid a real problem.

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:25.940
How does that sound?

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.240
That's really reassuring.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.640
Thank you so much.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.940
Thank you!

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:32.900
Go have a ball.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.700
I'm so pumped up to go to a pool.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.610
Me too.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.950
Not to mention all of STAR☆ANIS will be there! {mirakuru minna kuru kirakira kawaii daishuugou!}

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.950
Yeah, it's gonna be so much fun with Mizuki-san there!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.590
Ichigo-tan, you made it!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.310
Otome-chan, Sakura-chan, good morning.

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:25.840
Good morning.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.390
Now where are Yurika-sama and the others?

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.390
Tristar's going to come as soon as they finish up work.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.830
Work? But I thought we all had the day off.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.610
They really can't catch a break.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.710
I hope Mizuki-san can actually make it.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:41.070
Huh? You mean she might not come today?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:45.490
I know she said that she'd be here, but she's always unbelievably busy.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.690
I just know she'll come!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.500
She even said how excited she was for this!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.920
I'm going to play beach volleyball with Mizuki-san! {but they're not at a beach?} {beach volleyball is just volleyball in sand -- a lot of professional beach volleyball competitions aren't played at beaches either}

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.660
Yeah, I know she'll be here.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:58.600
That's right.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.260
Hold it!

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.050
You can't just jump in without preparation.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.310
Come back here and do your warm-ups.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.480
But before that, strike some poses.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:15.400
And what makes your swimsuit special?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.790
The frills and ribbons!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.480
My rainbow!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.950
You two are such cuties. {two're looks weird}

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.760
It's been a while since we could relax like this.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.410
Sakura, why're you covering up like that?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.450
This is the first swimsuit I have ever picked out for myself, so I'm unsure of how well it suits me...

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.100
Let's give it a look then.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:33.750
Certainly...

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.790
What do you think?

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.480
Pretty nice. That color looks perfect on you.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.830
Do you think so?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.730
You bet.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.890
Thanks for the Swimsuit Sakura-chan pics! {not enough delimitation to do the thing you did, though I like it}

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.390
Aoi-sama...

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.390
Sakura-chan, it's really cute on you.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.020
Squeeze in there, Ran.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.890
Ready, and Aikatsu!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:59.400
Aikatsu... Aikatsu...

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:00.970
Why's she doing crunches?

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.540
They're our warm-ups.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.900
Listen here...

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:08.070
What you're supposed to do before swimming is stretch your muscles.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.380
If you don't loosen up first, your legs are going to cramp up for sure.

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:16.410
Move slowly and breath naturally.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.840
Ran, did you use to swim or something?

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.590
Just a bit.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.840
How many meters can you swim?

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.810
Ten kilometers.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:30.900
Kilometers?!

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:32.120
I expected no less!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.090
She on a different level!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.610
You're so cool!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:36.230
It's not a big deal or anything.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:39.110
I wonder if you'd be able to beat a dolphin in a race.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.110
No chance of that.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.380
Besides, there's a huge difference between speed and marathon swimming.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.240
Pop Flash!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.240
Around Bouquet! {Around?} {eh, we're guessing anyway -- these are names of special appeals, right?}

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.190
Special Appeal failed.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:56.540
We were almost there!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.540
Ichigo, you're up! Ready?

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.990
Premium Angel Arrow!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.710
Ready, go!

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.350
Let's do this!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.110
That was so fun!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.620
Were you scared? {did you wet yourself?}

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.610
Never again.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.610
Ichigo-sama?

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.220
Ichigo!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:34.620
So high...

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.410
Ichigo-tan!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.760
The water slide is so great!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.940
I must've gone down ten times!

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.630
Everyone is so amazing.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.560
Let's go again!

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.640
Diamond Happy!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:55.930
This is great. {I actually just don't like the word "bliss"}

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.470
Powa Powa Puririn's still going strong!

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:02.060
Yes, we have a lot to do at our strategy meeting with Shion-sama later.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.960
I just thought up new song lyrics!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.130
I've gotta write it down!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.030
But we have yet to make an "old" song...

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.010
She makes sure she never forgets any new ideas.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.450
She's so diligent.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.910
What time is it now?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:18.960
Twelve thirty! {12:30?} {eh..}

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.670
Is your stomach that reliable?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.960
More than a clock!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:27.550
I wonder if Tristar's work ran late? They should be here by now.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:32.300
Powarin powarin, powa powarin!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:32.300
Powarin. Powarin. Powa powarin.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.470
Powarin, powarin, powa powa—

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.470
In what way is this different from our previous song?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.020
What way?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.520
Continue it as you were.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.350
Yurika-tan!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.350
Yurika-sama!

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:47.650
Those gently swaying lyrics can ease even Yurika-sama's tired soul.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.100
Yurika-chan!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.260
Welcome!

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.150
Sorry I kept you!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.400
Is it just you? What about the other two?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.500
Ran!

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:03.590
Hi, did you miss me?

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:04.500
Kaede!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.840
Kaede-chan!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.050
Can't you appear a bit more normally?

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.120
Normally?

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.720
You mean from the sky?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.700
It's not like I can just break through the ceiling to get in here.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.090
Never mind...

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.070
A squid?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.410
A <i>giant</i> squid.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.060
Where's Mizuki-san?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.700
She was supposed to come with us.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.820
She suddenly got called to do a radio show.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:33.110
Sorry about this, it's our fault that you have to do an additional recording.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.820
Not at all, I didn't have any plans anyway.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.830
No problem at all!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.130
It won't go in!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.610
I knew we should've bought a stand.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:55.590
Hello.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.550
Shall I assist you with that?

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.560
Well, honeys?

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.920
No thank you.

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.510
It must've been a bad location.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.910
Yeah, probably.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.060
Don't hesitate to ask me for help!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.070
Oh?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.440
Well, if it isn't Bepp-sensei.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.200
Academy Mother! Why are you here?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:18.320
I'm off! You can't do good work if you don't take some days off.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:22.370
A little breather today produces the strength to do your best tomorrow.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:24.830
Is that not why you are here?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:27.830
Yes.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.090
What's with the sunglasses?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.090
Man, the sun is so bright today.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.470
I hope our students are enjoying themselves as well.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.390
"I got a sudden call for a radio show, so I'll be a bit late.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:58.380
Sorry. Mizuki."

00:09:58.380 --> 00:09:59.490
Mizuki-san...

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.370
How long do you believe the recording will take?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.560
Even a half-hour show takes at least an hour to record.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.870
They make you talk for so long just to cut most of it out.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.360
I'll ask how long she thinks it'll take.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.290
Sure.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:17.850
Sorry for calling when you're at a job. 
How much longer do you think it'll take?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.510
If there are no hang-ups, another thirty minutes.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.670
I see.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.000
Thank you.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.910
She said Mizuki-san will just barely make it in time.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.840
But she <i>will</i> come, right?

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.520
I don't know. If it goes on much longer...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.240
She might miss us entirely...

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.360
That's a very real possibility.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:42.030
Huh?

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:44.760
Ichigo.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.480
Takoyaki!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.910
I love your smile.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.480
It's not like there's no chance of Mizuki making it.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:56.300
We're just losing time moping here!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.590
Yeah, let's have some fun.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:01.350
What should we do?

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:03.730
I know, let's race on the water slide!

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.230
Or we could relax in the hot spring pool.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.340
I'm on board with Sakura's idea.

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:10.900
Girls, I think you're forgetting something.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.980
There's a must-do event for idols!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.870
We're idols.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.370
How could we not have a water sports contest?

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.490
What's that?

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.650
A fundamental of the variety show!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:24.960
It's a legendary idol event that's been passed down through the ages! {and from east to west, etc.}

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.800
Here are the rules:

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.630
We'll split up into three teams of two and compete for points.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.280
There will be three games, each giving five points to the victors.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:40.130
Whoever has the most points at the end wins.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.280
Where did she pull those floating objects from?

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.260
It's like an athletics festival.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:46.390
What do we get if we win?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.600
A wonderful prize!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.990
To the winners go a Nandemo Bento Mega Seaweed bento!

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:53.650
With a free Mega Mini Burger on the side!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.600
A bento from Ichigo's shop!

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.480
Seaweed bento.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.920
Wow! A see-all-you-can-eat bento? {oai4ewt;kbnadf8yp9wbnkjdsf} {wow, you even got numbers into your mash. that's pretty advanced}

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:03.610
There's plenty of seaweed inside, so I'm sure your version of the name holds true as well.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.030
I'll refrain from entering.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.530
Can you not swim?

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.200
Actually, I'm quite good at it.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.420
It would just be an embarrassment to all vampires to participate for a lowly seaweed bento.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.670
I'd like a more high-class prize.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.300
It's yummy, you know.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:23.300
Then in addition to the see-all-you-can-eat bento, we'll let you observe one day of Tristar's activities.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.960
We can see you at work?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.140
I'm in!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.550
What happened to reffing?! {as in referee}

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.620
I want that too!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.480
I feel ready for anything!

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:35.600
I'm <i>in</i> Tristar, so there's nothing to gain.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.410
You're such a child, Yurika.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:41.800
Then on top of the bento and being allowed to watch Tristar for a day,

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.320
Mizuki will kiss you.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.500
We'll need to get permission.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.370
As if you could!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.990
It's just a greeting, so it's all okay.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.330
If that's too embarrassing, then you can kiss her instead.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.250
Like that's gonna fly!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.710
I'll do it.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:58.890
I have a promise with a fan I must fulfill.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.100
To one day... suck Mizuki-san's blood!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.420
Unfortunately, her guard is tight...

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.340
But now!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.220
If you want to blame someone, curse Kaede.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.220
My bloodsucking setup is perfect!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.230
Yurika-tan's finally serious.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.880
She's really aiming for Mizuki-san's neck!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.480
There's no guarantee that Yurika-chan will emerge victorious.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:25.740
From pen name "Mizuki is the Best"-san. {this looks so silly I kinda want to use it, but yours is fine}

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:27.740
I'm flattered.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.930
"Hello, Mizuki-san.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.830
I had so much fun at StaAni's live. {since they cut off one thing from each Star and Anis, but it looks grnhioht}

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.840
It became a wonderful summer memory just like Aoi-chan said it would.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.550
I only wish that it wasn't limited to such a short time."

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.000
That makes me so happy.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.460
We tried our best at concerts,

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.880
grew as idols,

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:49.260
and ate snacks together at the after-concert meetings.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.760
It was a memorable summer for me as well.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:56.270
Yes?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.500
This is Hoshimiya. About Mizuki-san's recording...

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:01.210
Now starting the first annual Starlight Academy Swim Meet! {liberties taken}

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.300
What's going on over there?

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.470
Sorry about that. So how's recording?

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.280
We'll still be here for a while.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.040
I see.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.670
Thank you for telling me.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.730
I'll call again.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:15.960
Ichigo-tan.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.920
She says Mizuki-san will be a bit longer.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.040
She's really planning to call again?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:24.170
It's time to reveal the teams!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.690
Stylish Thieves Swallowtail! {I think this is how we had it}

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.180
The Ichigo-Otome team!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.720
Rare! Next up is...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.670
We'll do anything for that kiss!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.230
I'm in this for the seaweed bento.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.130
The Ran-Kaede team!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.620
They have become one in mind and soul.

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:42.860
Up last is...

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:45.500
The Yurika-chan-Sakura-chan Team! {change all the - to /  ?} {I'm tempted to change them all to ｘs, but any of them is fine with me}

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.840
I won't forgive you if you drag your feet.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:51.870
Worry not, Kitaouji Sakura will put forth her utmost effort.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.620
These two are at the peak of serious business.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.570
Looks like something's going on.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:57.160
With who? {whom}

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.370
Huh? Aren't they...

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.000
First up is the obstacle course.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.510
The first member will race across the pool and tag her partner, who will then race back to the other side.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.310
Get ready...

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.260
Set... go!

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.140
All clear.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.840
Good work.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.360
Thank you very much.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.270
Oh, just one more thing.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:21.690
I'm sorry to spring this on you, but please autograph these as gifts for the listeners.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.200
Of course...

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.590
Sorry, but could we take those with us?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:29.730
Honoka-san?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:31.140
I'll get you there on the double.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.390
That's too reckless.

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:34.990
Don't worry, I'll be careful.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.120
Kiriya called on behalf of the girls.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.570
They kept on asking me when you'd be done.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:45.250
Don't you think it would be nice to make one last memory of STAR☆ANIS?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.490
You can autograph those on the way, right?

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.760
They'll turn out messy.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.480
That'll make them unique.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:56.360
And our first victors are Ran and Kaede!

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:57.890
Yes!

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.370
In second place is the Ichigo-Otome team!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:01.390
Yay!

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.140
Next time we won't lose!

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:04.690
Right!

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.400
Let's move on to the second stage!

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:11.490
I heard StaAni's here. {thing}

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:12.200
Seriously?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.480
Is it a TV recording?

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.160
I wonder if Mizuki-chan's there.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:18.700
Ichigo's team is dominating the yakisoba-making contest.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.540
Ichigo-tan, go for it!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.850
Japanese spaghetti is so heavy.

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.290
We're making eight whole servings.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.670
I want Mizuki-san to eat my cooking!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.440
Finished!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.220
Ichigo-tan is first!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.840
It's not the speed that matters, but the taste.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.680
Let's have at it before it gets cold.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.180
That smells nice.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:43.690
Mizuki-san.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.710
Sorry I'm late.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.230
Mizuki-san, I'm so happy you made it.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.970
Is that Kanzaki Mizuki?!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.490
Look over here!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.360
STAR☆ANIS!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.450
Mizuki-chan!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.750
It's really them!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:07.210
STAR☆ANIS! STAR☆ANIS!

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:06.710
What now?

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.600
There's no way we could sing for them.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.340
I believe we should nicely ask them to disband.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.530
But there are so many of them.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.470
We can't afford to have this get out of control.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.670
But still...

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.600
Why don't we just go for it?

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.000
You can't call us idols if we don't answer their cheers.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.050
If we're allowed to sing, then...

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:26.480
Is it really alright?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.480
It'll be our little secret.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.180
Right?

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:30.530
Fine, one song.

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:31.740
Thanks!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.700
Let's make another wonderful memory!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.320
STAR☆ANIS...

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.330
Start!

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:45.570
Everyone, be sure not to post about this on KiraKiratter or anything!

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:48.950
Keep your memory of this day locked safely in your hearts.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.920
Thank you very much for your patronage of Summer Pool Land.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.460
We hope to see you again.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:58.770
Too bad I didn't get the chance to play around.

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.010
Mizuki-san...

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:00.970
Girls!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:04.220
I persuaded the staff to let us stay for a while longer.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.720
Thanks so much, Honoka-san!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:08.660
Mizuki-san!

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.230
Time's a-wasting! {Wow, I thought this phrase when I watched it but I didn't think you'd actually use it}

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.790
Come on!

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:12.770
Go, go!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.460
Ichigo!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.740
Mizuki!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.880
It was a blast getting to sing with you again.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.380
I had a lot of fun too.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:45.340
The brighter the moon shines, the less you can see the stars around it.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:50.880
I expected to feel lonelier, but right now I'm happy.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.020
I'm so glad we formed STAR☆ANIS.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.000
Maybe it doesn't have to end.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.850
It doesn't even have to be STAR☆ANIS...

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.530
I want to be with you again.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.260
Me too, one day.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.030
Do you remember what I told you?

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:09.550
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:11.790
You might be able to become the sun.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.420
Is it because I'm not the sun yet?

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.720
But what do you mean by "sun"?

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.690
I realized it as I watched you.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.510
You and I are different.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.060
We shine in different ways.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.720
But you're still lacking.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.850
That amount of radiance can't overcome the moon.

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:33.630
We can't shine in the same sky.

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.190
I'll catch you!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:40.160
I'll shine with all of my might

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.030
and become the sun!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.360
I'll be waiting.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.330
Let's go!

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.200
Yeah!

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.210
That was so much fun!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.630
I'm so tired and sleepy.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:02.650
Me too.

00:22:03.310 --> 00:22:05.220
What about the swim meet results?

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:06.980
Ah, that's right.

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:08.220
We forgot about it.

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:10.080
Swim meet?

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.690
We competed for a kiss from you.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.610
I understand now.

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:15.910
Kaede.

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:18.150
Don't go betting other people's bodies.

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.660
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:01.540
This week's aphorism is... nothing!

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.780
Huh? What do you mean it's "nothing"?

00:24:03.780 --> 00:24:05.470
The director is off today.

00:24:05.470 --> 00:24:07.340
Director!

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:09.800
Let's all take a break.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:13.490
What was Mizuki-san doing during her mysterious year off?

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:17.310
Hmm, I believe she was trained by a truly amazing coach.

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:17.700
Right?

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:18.580
What?

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:19.960
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:21.360
Respect J☆.

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:25.940
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
